---- optimization status (Sept 2026) ----
DONE  optimizer moved to hygen (hygen/libhyopt, MIR level; compiler/opt.c per-instruction passes now off)
DONE  skip arena_init/free in functions that never `new`; arena blocks lazily mapped + pooled (fib 40s -> 0.011s)
DONE  a[i] / a[i]=v lowered inline (bounds check + load/store), header reads hoisted, bounds checks
      removed in `for (i < a.len)` loops and for repeated identical checks
DONE  SROA of struct locals, self-inlining of small recursive functions
DONE  mem2reg, copy/const propagation, CSE (local + global), DCE, loop rotation, LICM, inlining (within a module)
DONE  codegen: fused compare+branch/select/test, immediate + memory operands, lea/SIB addressing,
      args/params through parallel moves, frameless functions, 12 int regs, float constants in rodata
DONE  division/modulo by constants via multiply-high; if-conversion to cmov
TODO  cross-module inlining of runtime.hy/array.hy/mem.hy (they are separate objects),
      locals, induction-variable strength reduction, live-range splitting / shrink-wrapping
bench (bench/run.py): fib 1.9x C, loop 1.0x, sieve 1.0x, mandel 1.1x, collatz 1.4x, matmul 1.7x
